---
import StaticPage from '../layouts/StaticPage.astro';

const lastUpdated = 'October 5, 2026';
---

<StaticPage
	title="Privacy Policy"
	description="How FunToyKingdom collects, uses, shares, and protects your information when you visit our site."
	icon="🔒"
>
	<p class="updated" style="margin-top:-1rem;">Last updated: {lastUpdated}</p>

	<p>
		At <strong>FunToyKingdom</strong>, your privacy matters to us. We are committed to protecting your personal
		information and ensuring transparency in how we collect, use, store, and safeguard data. Because our website
		focuses on <strong>toys for babies, toddlers, children, and collectors</strong>, we take extra precautions
		regarding privacy—especially for parents, guardians, and child safety.
	</p>
	<p>
		This Privacy Policy explains in detail how we handle your personal information when you use our website,
		interact with our services, or engage with third-party partners through affiliate links, advertisements, or
		sponsored content.
	</p>
	<p>
		By accessing and using FunToyKingdom, you agree to the terms outlined in this Privacy Policy. If you do not
		agree, please discontinue use of our site.
	</p>

	<h2>1. Purpose of this Privacy Policy</h2>
	<p>This Privacy Policy aims to:</p>
	<ul>
		<li>Inform you about the <strong>types of information</strong> we collect.</li>
		<li>Explain how we <strong>use and share your data</strong>.</li>
		<li>Clarify your <strong>privacy rights and choices</strong>.</li>
		<li>Demonstrate our compliance with <strong>international privacy laws</strong>, including GDPR (Europe), CCPA (California), COPPA (Children's Privacy), and other applicable regulations.</li>
		<li>Reassure parents and guardians that we take <strong>child privacy and safety</strong> very seriously.</li>
	</ul>

	<h2>2. Information we collect</h2>
	<p>
		We collect both <strong>personal information</strong> (data that identifies you) and
		<strong>non-personal information</strong> (data that does not directly identify you).
	</p>

	<h3>Personal information you provide voluntarily</h3>
	<p>When you interact with FunToyKingdom, you may provide information such as:</p>
	<ul>
		<li>Name</li>
		<li>Email address (e.g., newsletter subscription, contact form)</li>
		<li>Phone number (if voluntarily submitted)</li>
		<li>Shipping or billing details (if applicable for purchases or giveaways)</li>
		<li>Any content you submit in forms, comments, or reviews</li>
	</ul>

	<h3>Information collected automatically</h3>
	<p>When you visit our website, we automatically collect certain data, including:</p>
	<ul>
		<li>IP address</li>
		<li>Browser type and version</li>
		<li>Device type (desktop, mobile, tablet)</li>
		<li>Operating system</li>
		<li>Referring/exit pages</li>
		<li>Time and date of visits</li>
		<li>Pages viewed and time spent on each page</li>
	</ul>

	<h3>Information from third parties</h3>
	<p>We may receive information about you from third parties, such as:</p>
	<ul>
		<li>Affiliate partners (purchase details after you click affiliate links)</li>
		<li>Advertising networks (general browsing behavior)</li>
		<li>Social media platforms (if you interact with our content via social login or sharing features)</li>
	</ul>

	<h2>3. How we use your information</h2>
	<p>We use your personal and non-personal information for the following purposes:</p>
	<ol>
		<li><strong>Website Functionality</strong> – To display content, provide navigation, and improve user experience.</li>
		<li><strong>Communication</strong> – To respond to inquiries, send newsletters, or deliver customer service.</li>
		<li><strong>Personalization</strong> – To suggest toys, articles, or products based on your preferences.</li>
		<li><strong>Marketing &amp; Promotions</strong> – To deliver targeted ads, sponsored content, or affiliate product recommendations.</li>
		<li><strong>Analytics</strong> – To analyze traffic trends, improve website performance, and enhance user experience.</li>
		<li><strong>Legal Obligations</strong> – To comply with regulatory requirements, fraud prevention, and security measures.</li>
	</ol>

	<h2>4. Use of cookies and tracking technologies</h2>
	<p>FunToyKingdom uses cookies, web beacons, and similar technologies to:</p>
	<ul>
		<li>Remember user preferences.</li>
		<li>Track website performance and analytics.</li>
		<li>Deliver targeted advertisements.</li>
		<li>Measure effectiveness of campaigns and affiliate links (see our <a href="/disclosure/">Disclosure</a> page).</li>
	</ul>
	<p>
		You can <strong>disable cookies</strong> through your browser settings, but some features of our website may
		not function properly without them.
	</p>

	<h2>5. Data sharing and disclosure</h2>
	<p>
		We value your trust and do not sell your personal information to third parties. However, we may share your
		data in the following situations:
	</p>
	<ol>
		<li><strong>Affiliate Partners:</strong> When you click on affiliate links, retailers may collect purchase-related data.</li>
		<li><strong>Service Providers:</strong> We may share information with third-party vendors who provide hosting, email, analytics, or advertising services.</li>
		<li><strong>Legal Compliance:</strong> If required by law, court orders, or regulatory authorities.</li>
		<li><strong>Business Transfers:</strong> If FunToyKingdom undergoes a merger, acquisition, or sale, your information may be part of the transferred assets.</li>
	</ol>

	<h2>6. Child privacy and COPPA compliance</h2>
	<p>
		Because FunToyKingdom features content about <strong>toys for children</strong>, we comply with the
		<strong>Children's Online Privacy Protection Act (COPPA)</strong> and similar child privacy regulations.
	</p>
	<ul>
		<li>Our content is intended for <strong>adults—parents, guardians, and educators—not children under 13</strong>.</li>
		<li>We do not knowingly collect personal information from children under 13.</li>
		<li>If we discover a child has provided us personal data, we will delete it immediately.</li>
		<li>Parents who believe their child has shared personal data with us should contact us at <a href="mailto:funtoykingdom@gmail.com">funtoykingdom@gmail.com</a>.</li>
	</ul>

	<h2>7. Data retention</h2>
	<p>We retain personal information only for as long as necessary to:</p>
	<ul>
		<li>Fulfill the purposes outlined in this Privacy Policy.</li>
		<li>Comply with legal and regulatory requirements.</li>
		<li>Resolve disputes and enforce agreements.</li>
	</ul>
	<p>Non-personal information (such as analytics data) may be stored indefinitely for research and trend analysis.</p>

	<h2>8. Data protection and security</h2>
	<p>We take appropriate technical and organizational measures to protect your data, including:</p>
	<ul>
		<li><strong>SSL Encryption</strong> – To secure data transmission.</li>
		<li><strong>Firewall Protection</strong> – To prevent unauthorized access.</li>
		<li><strong>Limited Access</strong> – Only authorized personnel have access to personal data.</li>
	</ul>
	<p>
		However, no method of data transmission or storage is 100% secure. We cannot guarantee absolute security but
		strive to safeguard data to the highest possible standard.
	</p>

	<h2>9. Your rights under GDPR</h2>
	<p>
		If you are a resident of the European Union (EU) or European Economic Area (EEA), you have specific rights
		under the <strong>General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR)</strong>, including:
	</p>
	<ul>
		<li><strong>Right to Access</strong> – Request a copy of the data we hold about you.</li>
		<li><strong>Right to Rectification</strong> – Correct inaccurate or incomplete information.</li>
		<li><strong>Right to Erasure</strong> – Request deletion of your data ("right to be forgotten").</li>
		<li><strong>Right to Restrict Processing</strong> – Limit how we process your data.</li>
		<li><strong>Right to Data Portability</strong> – Request your data in a portable format.</li>
		<li><strong>Right to Object</strong> – Opt-out of certain processing activities, including marketing.</li>
		<li><strong>Right to Withdraw Consent</strong> – Revoke consent at any time.</li>
	</ul>
	<p>To exercise these rights, contact us at <a href="mailto:funtoykingdom@gmail.com">funtoykingdom@gmail.com</a>.</p>

	<h2>10. Your rights under CCPA</h2>
	<p>
		If you are a <strong>California resident</strong>, you are protected under the
		<strong>California Consumer Privacy Act (CCPA)</strong>. Your rights include:
	</p>
	<ul>
		<li><strong>Right to Know</strong> – Request details about the personal data we collect and how we use it.</li>
		<li><strong>Right to Delete</strong> – Request deletion of personal information.</li>
		<li><strong>Right to Opt-Out</strong> – Prevent the sale of your personal data (we do not sell data, but we honor opt-out requests).</li>
		<li><strong>Right to Non-Discrimination</strong> – We will not deny services or offer different pricing if you exercise privacy rights.</li>
	</ul>
	<p>To exercise your CCPA rights, email us at <a href="mailto:funtoykingdom@gmail.com">funtoykingdom@gmail.com</a>.</p>

	<h2>11. Email communications and newsletters</h2>
	<p>If you subscribe to our newsletter or updates:</p>
	<ul>
		<li>We will use your email to send relevant content, promotions, or product updates.</li>
		<li>You can <strong>unsubscribe anytime</strong> via the "unsubscribe" link in our emails.</li>
		<li>We comply with anti-spam laws (CAN-SPAM, GDPR, etc.).</li>
	</ul>

	<h2>12. Third-party services and links</h2>
	<p>Our website may link to <strong>third-party websites</strong>. Please note:</p>
	<ul>
		<li>We are not responsible for their privacy practices.</li>
		<li>We encourage you to review their policies before sharing personal data.</li>
		<li>Affiliate retailers and ad networks may collect data independently.</li>
	</ul>

	<h2>13. Social media integration</h2>
	<p>
		FunToyKingdom may integrate with social platforms such as Facebook, Instagram, Pinterest, or YouTube. If you
		interact with us on these platforms:
	</p>
	<ul>
		<li>Your interactions are subject to the platform's own privacy policy.</li>
		<li>We may receive anonymized data (likes, shares, follows, etc.).</li>
	</ul>

	<h2>14. International data transfers</h2>
	<p>
		Since FunToyKingdom may operate globally, your information may be transferred to and stored in countries
		outside your own. By using our website, you consent to such transfers, provided appropriate safeguards are in
		place.
	</p>

	<h2>15. Policy for parents and guardians</h2>
	<p>We encourage parents to:</p>
	<ul>
		<li>Supervise their children's internet use.</li>
		<li>Guide children in understanding online safety.</li>
		<li>Contact us if they have concerns about data privacy related to children.</li>
	</ul>

	<h2>16. Changes to this Privacy Policy</h2>
	<p>We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. If we make significant changes, we will:</p>
	<ul>
		<li>Post an updated version on this page.</li>
		<li>Update the "Last updated" date at the top.</li>
		<li>Notify users via email or website announcement if applicable.</li>
	</ul>
	<p>Your continued use of FunToyKingdom after updates means you accept the revised Privacy Policy.</p>

	<h2>17. Contact us</h2>
	<p>If you have questions, concerns, or requests regarding this Privacy Policy, please contact us:</p>
	<ul>
		<li>📧 <strong>Email:</strong> <a href="mailto:funtoykingdom@gmail.com">funtoykingdom@gmail.com</a></li>
		<li>🌐 <strong>Website:</strong> <a href="https://www.funtoykingdom.com">www.funtoykingdom.com</a></li>
	</ul>
</StaticPage>
